{
  "desc": "Room layer vectors (spec/room.md). Every list is a table a client port must reproduce exactly. names: effectiveName(input, peerId, others, max, filter). data: applyData(spec, before, set, byHost) with the built-ins merged under spec. seats: chooseSeat over the ops. bans: banMatches(entry, candidate). autoStart: autoStartHolds. countdown: countdownRemaining(left, rtt) in ms (rtt null = none measured). admission: the order of checks of a join. defaultReasons, reasonRules and playerId as named. frames: the exact bytes of a room frame (type 0x80, route 0, then the JSON text).",
  "names": {
    "filters": {
      "none": null,
      "replace_darn": {
        "replace": [
          "darn",
          "****"
        ]
      },
      "empty": {
        "replace": [
          "darn",
          ""
        ]
      }
    },
